# Test: the three route-origination forms are three commands, each stating its own grammar
# VALIDATES: unicast, blackhole and flowspec each carry their own usage line, and
#            `send bgp` lists them as subcommands
# PREVENTS: three tail grammars behind one handler, which the model could state
#           at most one of, so the generated line named a selector no operator
#           types and spelled the rest <args>
#
# Each form answers at ONE path, `send bgp <selector> <form>`. The selector is
# declared on the bgp container, so every usage line below carries it in the same
# position, which is what proves it is anchored to the keyword the operator types
# it after rather than restated by each form.
#
# The line each form states is the one the MODEL renders. flowspec is the form
# whose components another plugin owns: they arrive through the augment
# ze-flowspec-cmd puts on this container, so the line proves the augment reached
# the tree as well as that the form states its own grammar.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze send bgp help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze send bgp <command> [options]
expect=stderr:contains=Commands
expect=stderr:pattern=(?m)^  unicast\s
expect=stderr:pattern=(?m)^  blackhole\s
expect=stderr:pattern=(?m)^  flowspec\s
reject=stderr:pattern=send bgp <selector> <args>

cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze send bgp unicast help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze send bgp <selector> unicast <prefix> [next-hop <address>] [community <value> ...] [tag <key> <value>] [for <duration>]

cmd=foreground:seq=3:exec=ze send bgp blackhole help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze send bgp <selector> blackhole <prefix> [tag <key> <value>] [for <duration>]

cmd=foreground:seq=4:exec=ze send bgp flowspec help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=ze send bgp <selector> flowspec [destination-ipv4 <prefix> ...]
expect=stderr:contains=[tcp-flags <value> ...] (community <value>|rate-limit <bytes-per-second>|discard) [tag <key> <value>] [for <duration>]
reject=stderr:pattern=flowspec <args>
